# STIG AS24-U2-000020: The Apache web server must perform server-side session manag
# STIG ID: V-214277 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `apache-as24-u2-000020-session-module-site-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `apache`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG AS24-U2-000020: The Apache web server must perform server-side session management.`
    description `The Apache web server must perform server-side session management.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `apache,stig,disa-stig,module`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:AS24-U2-000020,NIST-800-53:AC-10`
    control_objective `AC-10`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Apache:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Apache STIG guidance for AS24-U2-000020.`

    component_id `comp-apache-web`

    impl_AC_10 `This control is validated by checking the Apache HTTP server configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT module_check
        module `session_module`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE module_state
        loaded boolean = true
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN apache_module
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF module_state
            OBJECT_REF module_check
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
